 R12c3_res_rowphase_preload4 kernel=gemv_hfq4g256_residual lever=res_rowphase_preload4 verdict=DEAD delta_pct=-0.10 f=0.438 learned=Row-local four-header preload phases unexpectedly raised VGPR 72->96; at 26.6% occupancy and 55.1% mem_busy, TLP already hides latency, so splitting the dual-row memory/FMA schedule does not relieve the real bottleneck.
