+R9c2_res_single_row kernel=gemv_hfq4g256_residual lever=single_row verdict=DEAD delta_pct=-3.51 f=0.000 learned=Splitting the dual-row wave raised occ 6.6->52.3% and mem_busy 8.8->54.9% at unchanged 72 VGPR but lost 3.51%; residual is not occupancy/MLP-limited and needs the dual-row layout's per-wave reuse/ILP.
