codex
The selected kernel is L2-resident but only ~16% occupied; its prior dead attempts either increased register pressure or changed data layout. I’m testing a different ILP lever: issue the independent Q/K/V loads before the gate’s `expf`, so cache-load latency can overlap the transcendental pipeline without changing any arithmetic or reduction order.
apply patch
