codex
The fresh lever is `gdn_state_sprefetch`: prefetch the three later quantized-state rows before the serial state expansion. This targets the remaining L2-miss tail without changing the reduction/update arithmetic or increasing live state; it is compile-gated to gfx12 so other architectures’ kernels stay byte-identical.
