+// R3c2 grouped_wmma_nextgroup_sprefetch: gfx1201-only next-group weight
+// prefetch. The hot A3B grouped GEMM is cache-resident but retains ~22% L2
+// misses; issue the next 136-byte packed-weight group while the current
+// group's four dequant/WMMA steps execute. The #if keeps gfx1200 and every
+// other architecture byte-identical to the baseline source.
