codex
The variant is a gfx12-only phase-2 remap: four warps each process two independent 256-element FWHT groups, while the RMS reduction remains eight-warps wide. This keeps the current 48-VGPR-style data path (no second-group register staging) and increases useful work per active wave without altering any group’s arithmetic or stores.
